# tuning: macros/tuning_parameters_hkfd.mac
# HK FD inner + outer detector as built (WCSim/WCSim develop e2dc7a48 /WCSim/WCgeom HyperK_HybridmPMT_WithOD_Realistic),
# its nominal settings. G4OpWLS's time profile is WCSim's own, exponential (WCSimPhysicsListFactory.cc:154 sets it at
# initialisation, over WCSimOpticalPhysics' "delta"); the command below sets the same value again. Sources follow.
/run/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/hits/verbose 0
/WCSim/WCgeom HyperK_HybridmPMT_WithOD_Realistic
/WCSim/Construct
/process/optical/wls/setTimeProfile exponential
